	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020220"},
		line=1612,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"We race as fast as we can to the source of the commotion.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The two fighters are indeed Hotori and Maki.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Likely forbidden to interfere, Koyuzu is standing helplessly on the sidelines.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori!”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“What, you brought Tokita, too?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“T-Tokita-san...”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Maki casually rests his colossal spellblade on his shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"There's not a single scratch on his body.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"In comparison, Hotori already sports several shallow wounds.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Maki seems to be getting the better of her.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How is Kokuan?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Father is...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Hotori begins, but doesn't manage to get the words out.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I put him outta his misery.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They tortured him for all he was worth and wrung him out like a rag. Ain't no point keepin' him alive after that.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Kazuma jerks his chin at the cell behind him.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"In it, a man lays in the corner, as emaciated as a withered tree.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"His body is covered with telltale scars of the Republic's vicious torture.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono... Forgive us...",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You lot are a bunch of dumbasses.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Comin' out all this way for a useless sack of garbage like that.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, ain't all that bad, though. Least I get the chance to take on Inou without anyone gettin' in the way.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Cur.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Hotori steadies her blade, its tip aimed right between\nMaki's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Huh. Even after all that, your form's as perfect as ever, innit?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“...That's always been what I hated most about youuu!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Maki lunges forward with a thunderous roar.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Despite his colossal blade being almost as tall as Hotori herself, he wields it with the precision of a rapier, plunging it straight for Hotori's heart.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Hotori dodges his thrust by a hair's breadth and counters with a slash at his defenseless left flank.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"A normal warrior wouldn't have even been able to follow her blade, but Maki deftly sidesteps it with a smirk on his face.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Been there, seen that. You tryna put me to goddamn sleep with those same ol' moves of yours?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Inou... stop fuckin' around and draw Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Kokuan's pushin' up daisies already, so what's there left\nholdin' you back?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Hotori freezes and stiffens at Maki's words.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Her fingers drift towards Shiranui at her hip.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"But they close around thin air before settling back around the hilt of her original blade.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Enough! I refuse to tolerate this petty quarrel any longer!”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Zip it, girlie.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" avenge my father.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, stand down this instant!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Hotori falteringly alternates looks between me and Akari.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"With great reluctance, she eventually lowers her blade, looking for all the world like she's just swallowed a terribly bitter pill.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Whoa, whoa, whoa there. What's the big idea, Inou?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“It's Maki versus Inou. Now's our chance to finally settle the score for good.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You forgettin' who it was that killed Kokuan? Gonna give it up just 'cause this little girlie told you to?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Facing Maki's glare head-on, Akari wordlessly approaches the two of them.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou is my vassal. It's only natural that she should heed my will.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maki Kazuma, dare you to defy me?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Just who the hell do you think you are?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I am the first and eldest daughter of the late Empress Suou.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Crown Princess of the Empire, and the sole legitimate successor to the Imperial throne.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"For a brief moment, even Maki is stunned into silence.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Bullshit.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Maki readies his blade once again.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maki...!”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Know your place. You stand before Her Imperial Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"He glares at Akari with a look that could kill.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Akari wordlessly meets his gaze.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Even the air between them seems to stand still.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“If that's the case, looks like today's my lucky day.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Should I take that to mean you believe me?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Nah, this is all goin' way over my head.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“And honestly, I ain't impressed either way.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Kazuma's grip grows tighter around his blade.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you not call yourself a warrior?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I dunno if you're an impostor or the real deal, but in either case, I ain't about to bow down to you.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki, you scoundrel!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“On the name of House Maki, I won't back down here.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Three hundred years. That's how long we've lived under House Inou's thumb, ever since that goddamned match before the Emperor.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“We've petitioned for another match over and over, but the Inous always had some bullshit excuse about keepin' the peace.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They were just scared of losin', but they repeated it enough that even the Imperial Family started swallowin' that drivel.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“What sorta self-respectin' warrior doesn't rise up to a\nfuckin' challenge!?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Kazuma contemptuously spits out his tirade before licking his lips.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I will have Inou's head.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“And if you get in my way, I'll have yours, too.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"He levels his blade directly at Akari.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your grievances have been heard.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall grant your petition. Let us hold an official match, here and now.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Haha, now that's what I'm talkin' about.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But understand that this is merely a contest, not a fight to the death.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You are hereby ordered to stay your blade as soon as the match is settled.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Sure thing...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“But we're still usin' real blades, you know. Who's to say if a little accident won't happen?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Maki smirks an ominous smile.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And make it known to all future generations that you lack even such basic restraint?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You've got a real mouth on you, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"He retorts with a shrug.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Very well. No objections 'ere.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...I also accept.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Hotori declares with a stern expression.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Maki is the one who slayed Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"She surely has a score of her own to settle.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Very good.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Akari nods in satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, I appoint you officiator of this match.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I humbly accept.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"The first official match in over three hundred years is about to commence.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Maki has been granted an opportunity to challenge House Inou with a member of the Imperial Family as witness.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"He surely could not have asked for anything more.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Akari has found a way to appease Maki's resentment without any blood needing to be shed.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, a moment, please.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Hotori gallantly steps up to her.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Akari grabs her by the shoulders and fixes her with a steadfast gaze.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You are a worthy vassal, Inou. I have absolutely no doubt in my mind of that.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm placing my faith in you. Don't let me down.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course. I shan't let him best me.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Very good.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Saying no more, Akari simply sends Hotori unto battle against Maki with a pat on the back.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"The heads of House Inou and House Maki square off against each other.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin, of the Myougikan.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will be serving as the officiator for this bout.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hey, Tokita, before we fight, mind verifyin' whether my opponent is really the head of House Inou as she claims?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What is the meaning of this?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"At this, Maki meets my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Unlike before, his feral eyes are not those of a rabid dog.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"The eyes that stare into mine are the lucid eyes of an ageless tiger.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"─It's the same look he gave me back then.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"I think back to Hotori and Maki's showdown in the Sworn Blades headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"He had the same look in his eyes even as he staved in the conference table and stormed off in a rage.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Now that I've heard Mutsumi-san's story, I'm sure that\nthere's a method to his madness.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How do you propose to do that?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“With Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Shiranui only shows its true power when taken up by the head of House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“If that woman gives it a try, we'll be able to tell straight away.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Hotori's expression hardens at this declaration.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“We're in the presence of Her Highness, ain't we? You\nwouldn't be thinkin' of pullin' your punches, would you?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Would you know Shiranui's true form?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You have no idea.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I was the one fightin' alongside Kokuan while the\nRepublic's bombs were rainin' down.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I could never... forget that sight.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You fought alongside Father?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Shiranui's flames were the one light of hope on that godforsaken battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“It was enough to make me believe that we couldn't lose so long as that fire kept burnin'.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, fuckin' Okonogi went and raised the white flag in the end, so we lost the war anyways.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"I can feel Maki's deep trust in Kokuan-dono from the way he speaks of him.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"He doesn't hate Kokuan-dono at all.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Even after all that, Shiranui's fire still kept burnin' bright within the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Until you extinguished it, Inou Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Kokuan left Shiranui to you durin' the August Incident.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I'm sure you knew what he meant by that.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“To rebuild the Blades from the brink of collapse, you needed to raise those flames high and show everyone the way.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“And yet, you let that damn thing collect dust in a drawer.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You couldn't bear the weight of your responsibility, so you never once unsheathed it, am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm... the one who led the Myougi Squad to ruin.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“So what if you are?!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"He sweeps Hotori's excuses aside with a roar.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Draw Shiranui. This is your last chance.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Hotori remains motionless as a statue.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Up until now, Hotori has always denied her status as head of House Inou and chairman of the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I had believed it was out of deference to Kokuan-dono, but now that Kokuan-dono is confirmed to be dead, it's obvious.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Hotori's hesitation has nothing to do with her deference to her father.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Rather, it has everything to do with her confidence in herself...",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Hotori has never been able to trust herself ever since the day she led the Myougi Squad to ruin.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"That's why, whether she realized it or not, she has always been hiding in Kokuan-dono's shadow.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Of course, she fully devoted herself to serving as the\nBlades' acting chairman, and at first blush, there didn't seem to be any problems.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"But just as you can push yourself to move even with a heavy wound, it doesn't change the fact that it will continue bleeding all the while.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"If Hotori is to heal her wounds of her heart for good, is now not the time?",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori, you are to draw Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's just Maki. I don't need Shiranui to...”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That is my official ruling.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Hotori's hands are trembling.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"She stares down at her palms as though she doesn't even register what she is seeing.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Draw your blade, Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“With the passing of Kokuan-dono, you are now the chairman of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Prove your status as the head of House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But... I...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you don't draw Shiranui now, you will never be able to do it.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Draw your blade. And with it...”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Cut down your weak past self.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Hotori will never be able to move forward unless she does this.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"She has to cut away the Hotori who is still held prisoner by the events of the war three years ago.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"She has to slay the Hotori who fears taking the lead and insists on calling herself the acting chairman.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"And most important of all...",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"She has to extirpate the Hotori who, even now, wallows in the seductively sweet abnegation of self-loathing.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Slowly, Hotori finds her resolve.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Her fists are clenched so tightly that they seem almost to be crushing away her own hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's right... all this time, I've wanted to kill myself.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“My weak self, and none other!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Hotori grips Shiranui once again.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki, if you doubt me, then behold.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is the hallowed ancestral blade of House Inou, Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Dare you to still doubt my claim as the rightwise Executor of the warriors' will?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"She raises Shiranui aloft for all to see.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Her hands close tightly around its ornate hilt and scabbard.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Closing her eyes and drawing a deep breath...",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"She slowly unsheathes the blade in one smooth motion.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"What emerges is a red-hot span of steel, as though pulled straight from a bladesmith's forge.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Divine flames capable of setting the whole world ablaze dance and flicker all across its edge.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Containing the souls of nine priestesses, it is a keenblade amongst keenblades─",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shiranui, it's time.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Immediately, the dungeon flares up with a scorching light.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"In perfect resonance with Hotori's voice, Shiranui's flames roar even brighter and instantly raise the temperature of the narrow corridor.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hahaha! It's about damn time, Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Now those are the flames of House Inou. I'd never mistake\n'em.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"In turn, Maki raises the spellblade handed down through generations of House Maki, ",
{"ruby", text="Ebon Iron"},
"Kurogane.",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Kurogane dramatically increases the constitution of its wielder.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Its colossal heft can rend apart boulders like rock candy, and despite its innumerable scratches, its edge remains as keen as the day it was forged.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Since time immemorial, the head of House Maki has always been found at the tip of the Empire's vanguard.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Maki Kazuma. Head of House Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori. Head of House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Begin!”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"At once, Shiranui spews forth a blazing dragon of flame.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Even at a distance, the fierce heat threatens to scorch my skin, but Maki doesn't even flinch.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Maki locks blades with Hotori as he bellows out a roaring laugh.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"His hair immediately catches fire, and an acrid plume of white smoke drifts up from his clothes.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Even with Kurogane, he cannot fully resist Shiranui's heat.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Over and over, Hotori's blade of flaming red and Maki's blade of ebon black cross each other.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"All the while, Akari never takes her eyes off their fighting forms.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"She dares not to even blink.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"As the clash of pure strength goes on, Hotori begins to slowly push Maki back.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Tchhh!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Maki disengages and takes his distance, kicking up a cloud of pebbles.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"A cheap trick, meant to catch Hotori off her guard.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shiranui!”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"A mighty gust of flame scours the pebbles before they ever reach her.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Even Maki trembles slightly as the intense wave of heat passes over him.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Hotori doesn't miss this opening.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"Shiranui meets Maki's blade head on...",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"And with a high-pitched clatter, Kurogane falls to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Match!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Our vindication just wasn't meant to be, huh...”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Hotori disperses Shiranui's flames with a flourish and returns the blade to its sheath.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That was a fine display.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall never forget this display of bladesmanship I witnessed.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maki, have you any objections to this outcome?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Nah...”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"The first official match in over three hundred years has concluded.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"The only witness was a single member of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"Its spectacle could not hope to compare to the legendary match three hundred years ago that held the entire Empire on the edge of their seats.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"But the spirits of the two who crossed blades today are surely just as noble.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Father...”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"As soon as she stows her blade, Hotori wastes no time in approaching Kokuan-dono's prison cell.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"His body, no more than a pile of skin and bones, is a pitiful sight to behold.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"Hotori kneels motionlessly over him for some time.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This... isn't Father...”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He has a tattoo that my father doesn't. His musculature\nisn't that of a warrior either.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"I turn my gaze to Maki, who looks at me with a scornful sneer.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Kokuan was never here in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“All that was just Okonogi's bait to lure you out here.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Then my father is still in good health?!”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hell if I know...”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If the rumors about Kokuan-dono were meant to lure us into a trap, then why are you the only one here? What happened to the rest of the Forbidden Guard?”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They decided to foist the job on the new recruit.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Said they're scared of fighting warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"It doesn't add up.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"It makes absolutely no sense to lure us all the way out here, only to leave everything up to just Maki.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maki, could you have been trying to protect us from the Forbidden Guard?”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"At Akari's words, Maki takes on a sheepish grin.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"It looks like Akari's guess was right on the money.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It seems I owe you my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, fuck off with that.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Just get your ass back home and set the Blades straight.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“The Forbidden Guard ain't gonna wait around forever.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you gonna do now?”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Er... Didn't quite think that far ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course you didn't...”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I kinda like people like that.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Akari steps in front of Maki.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You may have lost the match, but there's no doubt in my mind that your prowess as a warrior is second only to one other.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Would you return to the Sworn Blades and lend Inou your strength in order to restore the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This is a request from the daughter of Empress Suou herself.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Sorry, but no can do.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You accepted the conditions of the match, didn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That necessarily means you've recognized me as a member of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So that means you'll be following my orders from now on, right?”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Maki stares blankly at her for several moments.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"It's not a look I've ever seen on his face before.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Pfft...”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, well, missy. Ain't you a real go getter or what?”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You see, I've already resigned. I can't show my face at the Blades no more.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"Before Akari can say anything, Hotori takes Maki's letter of resignation out of her pocket and hands it to her.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Request denied.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"Akari deftly tears the letter of resignation to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We haven't made your resignation public yet.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So there shouldn't be any problems at all.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Whoa there. Is that what the inspector general oughta be\nsayin'?”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is an unsanctioned operation. I'm just an ordinary civilian right now.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Fuckin' hell, you've got an answer for everythin', huh? Goddamn pain in my ass...”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"Muttering to himself, Maki walks away from us to pick up his spellblade he dropped earlier.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Tch... Have it your way.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I swear, you lot always throw me off my game.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Still cursing us out under his breath, Maki sheathes his spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"Hotori steps up to face Maki.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, cut it out, acting chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Or rather, guess I should just be callin' you 'chairman' now.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Maki amends his words.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"He's fully recognized Hotori's claim.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Welp, no point stickin' 'round here any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"Just as Maki prepares to turn around, a trace of movement appears behind his back.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"A metallic clattering sound bounces down the narrow corridor.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"A flash grenade?!",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin & Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh!” “Nnh!”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"I immediately move to shield Akari.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"The blinding flash and ear-splitting explosion races up to meet us.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"I managed to shield my eyes, but my sense of hearing is completely gone.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"Unable to ask, I confirm that Akari is unharmed with my eyes alone.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"Before I can do anything else, a flare of muzzle flashes appears from behind Maki.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“!!!”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			{
"Even at this close distance, I can't hear Maki's howl.",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"The only thing I can perceive in this silent world are the convulsions of his body as the bullets tear into him.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			{
"He's blocked all the bullets from reaching us with his own body.",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			{
"This man...",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ngh!”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"Maki turns to face me.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"He's stretched himself across the entire corridor to cover us.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“!!!”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"His lips mouth out a clear message.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			{
"“Take good care of Hotori...”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"Maki's smile overlaps with that of Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"Just like on that August day.",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"Just like on that day, I'm losing someone important.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's in good hands!”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"Right by my side, Hotori is also staring up at Maki.",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"Just like me, she seems to have protected her sense of sight.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"I forcefully grab Hotori by the hand.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“!!”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go!”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Without Maki to hold back the enemy, all of us are going to die.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“!!!!!”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We have to go!”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			{
"In order to fulfill my duty to him, and to her...",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"I do the only thing I am able, and run with all my might.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			{
"Tokita and his crew finally disappear around the corner of the underground passage.",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"Those damn kids better make it outta here alive...",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Gaaaaaaaahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"The pain is intense enough to make me feel like I'm being burned alive.",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			{
"Whoa, now... Even with Kurogane, ain't this gonna be a bit tough?",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			{
"I turn around to take stock of the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"About twenty Republican soldiers, and behind them, a woman I've seen on the television more than a couple times.",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ahh... No wonder this felt like a damn dirty trick... It's that blonde Republican chick.”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Have you betrayed Okonogi?”",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You said you'd guard the dungeon alone, so I had my suspicions...”",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Really, what is Okonogi thinking, trusting a warrior just like that?”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“He ain't got anythin' on his brain but money.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehee, that's a good point.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			{
"The woman lets out a relaxed giggle, like she's flexing her own composure.",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I do apologize, but I have no intentions to let you leave here alive.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“What a coincidence. Neither do I.”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"I take up Kurogane.",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Now, why don't we settle the score from three years ago?”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Better pray to your god while you still have the chance.”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Unlike Okonogi, I ain't about to sign any damn peace treaty.”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			{
"At last, a chance to unleash the fury I've been holding back ever since the August Incident.",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			{
"Now that the chairman's come into her own, I have no more regrets.",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			{
"All that's left is to burn my life away, just as a warrior should.",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			{
"─Ain't that right, Kokuan-dono?",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
